      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel this way when patterns of loss are so consistent; those repeated failures feel like undeniable proof of a flaw. Instead of viewing yourself as a system that is broken, perhaps you could start viewing the situation as a pattern that requires a different kind of intervention. A different kind of intervention might involve finding a very small, controllable area where you can build something new, no matter how tiny.",
